[26.87104, "o", "> "]
[26.871141, "o", "   - Extract the count of roles as '\"'\"'role_count'\"'\"'.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[26.871159, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[26.871186, "o", "> "]
[26.87147, "o", "   - Extract the first role from the '\"'\"'roles'\"'\"' array as '\"'\"'primary_role'\"'\"' (if roles exist, otherwise null).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[26.871489, "o", "> "]
[26.871765, "o", "4. **Sort Users**: Sort the resulting users alphabetically by their '\"'\"'username'\"'\"' in ascending order.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
